{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an epic journey with Galactic Conquest Universe, the pioneering real-time strategy game that redefines the genre with live voxel terrain deformation. Watch as landscapes shift under the fire of your weapons\u2014reshaping tactics on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Command one of six distinct factions, each with unique units, buildings, and playstyles. Master your economy via a comprehensive marketplace where healthy trade can fuel your war machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Developed in Unity with a charming low\u2011poly aesthetic, Galactic Conquest Universe balances approachable visuals with deep, dynamic gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your battlefield: intense PvP 1\u2011on\u20111 matches on compact maps, or test your endurance in survival mode\u2014now to level 15, with limitless future rounds, boss waves, and new biomes on the roadmap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With continuous post-launch support\u2014adding maps, factions, UI enhancements, and more\u2014your battlefield will evolve long after launch. Add to your wishlist and get ready to lead your faction through a shifting warzone.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3350350?t=1752780433","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3350350?t=1752780433","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350350/98279ae27fb519428f9cfd1caed973794a0b22bb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752780433","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350350/98279ae27fb519428f9cfd1caed973794a0b22bb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752780433","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3760990,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on an epic journey with Galactic Conquest Universe, the pioneering real-time strategy game that redefines the genre with live voxel terrain deformation. Watch as landscapes shift under the fire of your weapons\u2014reshaping tactics on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Command one of six distinct factions, each with unique units, buildings, and playstyles. Master your economy via a comprehensive marketplace where healthy trade can fuel your war machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Developed in Unity with a charming low\u2011poly aesthetic, Galactic Conquest Universe balances approachable visuals with deep, dynamic gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your battlefield: intense PvP 1\u2011on\u20111 matches on compact maps, or test your endurance in survival mode\u2014now to level 15, with limitless future rounds, boss waves, and new biomes on the roadmap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With continuous post-launch support\u2014adding maps, factions, UI enhancements, and more\u2014your battlefield will evolve long after launch. Add to your wishlist and get ready to lead your faction through a shifting warzone.</p>","developers":["Azulon Studios"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Google Firebase ","genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350350/634b2f61108302570670a5d0338f6cc9bd912a88/header.jpg?t=1752780433","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":false,"id":257123706,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123706/movie480.mp4?t=1744136767","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123706/movie_max.mp4?t=1744136767"},"name":"Showcase","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257123706/71f91f23821a751e9b110509801e5715748ee515/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744136767","webm"